<title>USA: General Chemical to acquire Peridot.</title>
<headline>General Chemical to acquire Peridot.</headline>
<dateline>HAMPTON, N.H. 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Chemical Group Inc said Tuesday that it has agreed to acquire privately held Peridot Holdings Inc, a manufacturer of sulfuric acid and water treatement chemicals.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction, which is subject to regulatory approval, were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Peridot is based in Pompton Plains, N.J. and had sales of $46 million in 1996. General Chemical, a diversified chemical maker, had sales of $624 in 1996.</p>
</text>
